*--------

*Inverter NMOS stacked
*MP1 OUT A VDD VDD PMOS L={L_value} W={W_value}

*MN1 OUT A  TS  0  NMOS L={L_value} W={W_value}
*MN2 TS  A  0   0  NMOS L={L_value} W={W_value}

*--------

*Inverter Double Stacked
MP1 TSP A VDD VDD PMOS L={L_value} W={W_value}
MP2 OUT A TSP VDD PMOS L={L_value} W={W_value}

MN1 OUT A TSN  0  NMOS L={L_value} W={W_value}
MN2 TSN A  0   0  NMOS L={L_value} W={W_value}

*--------

*Voltage sources
VDD VDD 0 1.8
V_A  A  0 0




